<title>USA: Continental American cannot explain drop.</title>
<headline>Continental American cannot explain drop.</headline>
<dateline>CALHOUN, Ga. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental American Transportation Inc said Tuesday that it was unaware of any reason for the recent decline in its stock price.</p>
<p>Continental was trading at $1.75 at 1330 EST/1830 GMT Tuesday, down from $1.93 the previous day. Its 52-week high is $5.10.</p>
<p>The company said it has scheduled a teleconference for October 31 at 1605 EST/2105 GMT.</p>
</text>
